<title>BERMUDA: 3Dlabs names chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>3Dlabs names chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Bermuda 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>3Dlabs Inc Ltd said on Wednesday that Douglas Miller had joined the company as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Tom Donohue, the company's vice president of finance and chief operating officer, will continue to be based in the U.K., the company said.</p>
<p>3Dlabs is an innovator and supplier of high-performance graphics semiconductors, software, and related technologies.</p>
<p>It was not immediately known whom he replaced.</p>
</text>
